  "details": "I know streamer mode does this but not being able to see instance info, profile pictures, etc can get annoying at times. I'd like to see a few auto decline options/toggles such as:\n\n-Decline friend requests from people who aren't in the same world as you at the time of the request.\n\n-Just an auto decline option in general.\n\nWith both of these you'd still be able to send requests to others, you just won't receive requests.",
